       "reasons": [
        {
         "@type": "meaningComprehension",
         "comprehends": [
          "copies/xg976jt9573.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "ink, upright in the lower panel, a steeply right-leaning hand; read after shearing the line upright. Six figures, evenly spaced and without separators: 1, 4, 1, 9, 2, 5. The 9 is a closed loop with a plain descender, distinct from the 2 beside it, which carries the usual base stroke. Of the possible groupings only 1 | 4 | 1925 gives a date, so 1 April 1925; 14 | 19 | 25 would need a nineteenth month. The 4 is the least certain figure. Crop 2 carries a pencilled four-figure number, 5571 or 5521, its third figure crossed like a 7; crop 3 shows the printed label, WELTE-MIGNON No. 5521, 'My Isle of Golden Dreams', Waltz, Walter Blaufuss, played by Henry Dark. Crop 4 not needed."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
